msgstr ""
"FoxIO. *JA4+ Network Fingerprinting*. https://github.com/FoxIO-LLC/ja4، "
"2023 (بصمة عميل TLS من نوع JA4)."

#: ../../glossary.rst:109
msgid ""
"Hanson, N. \"libinjection: SQL injection detection by tokenization.\" "
"Black Hat USA, 2012."
msgstr ""
"Hanson, N. \"libinjection: SQL injection detection by tokenization.\" "
"Black Hat USA, 2012."

#: ../../glossary.rst:110
msgid ""
"Juels, A., and Brainard, J. \"Client puzzles: a cryptographic "
